        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_219_meteo_1#4"
    },
    {
        "text": "Who? Is that.. Amiya?!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Meteorite"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_219_meteo_1#5"
    },
    {
        "text": "Amiya! Amiya, you really came!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Meteorite"
    },
    {
        "text": "It's so good to see you...",
