    {
        "text": "...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Meteorite"
    },
    {
        "text": "...but you shouldn't have come. This whole thing is one big trap.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Meteorite"
    },
    {
        "text": "It wasn't worth it for you to come to our rescue.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Meteorite"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1",
        "name2": "char_219_meteo_1#3",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "This was the wrong decision...!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Meteorite"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_193_frostl_1"
    },
    {
        "text": "There's no point in blaming her now.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Frostleaf"
    },
    {
        "text": "Besides, even if everyone else doesn't think you can be rescued, Amiya would still not give up on you.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Frostleaf"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1",
        "name2": "char_219_meteo_1#5",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "I wasn't blaming her! It's just that...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Meteorite"
    },
    {
        "text": "Tsk. Sorry, Amiya.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Meteorite"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1#2",
        "name2": "char_219_meteo_1#5",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "It's okay. I'm just glad to see that you're all still safe.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1#2",
        "name2": "char_219_meteo_1#5",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Amiya...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Meteorite"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1",
        "name2": "char_219_meteo_1#5",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "But... what happened to Jessica?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_259_Jessica_1#5"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "text": "Ugh...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Jessica"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1",
        "name2": "char_219_meteo_1#5",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "She's... still in shock.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Meteorite"
    },
    {
        "text": "Originally, I wanted to wait for her to get better, but...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Meteorite"
    },
    {
        "text": "It seems like she's been... traumatized.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Meteorite"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_259_Jessica_1#5"
