        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1#4"
    },
    {
        "text": "This is all I can do...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Frostleaf, do me a favor. Place her hands on my arm, and hold her fingers tight.",
